OL,5,G1745 The Chase Around the World
OL,6,     FThe teams arrive in Zurich, where
OL,7,     Fthe Governess and Dark Destroyer
OL,8,     Fchallenge them with quizzes
OL,9,     Fguiding their race to Bradley
OL,10,     FWalsh. Starting on Lake Zurich,
OL,11,     Fthey tackle Einstein-themed games,
OL,12,     Fvisit the FIFA Museum and a
OL,13,     Fchocolate factory, then head into
OL,14,     Fthe Alps for a cable-car quiz and
OL,15,     FJames Bond villain's lair
