OL,5,G2000 Van Der Valk
OL,6,     FWhen a scientist researching a
OL,7,     Fpotential breakthrough in the
OL,8,     Ftreatment of cancer is found dead,
OL,9,     Fseemingly assassinated by a
OL,10,     Fprofessional killer, Piet has to
OL,11,     Fdiscover why he was killed and
OL,12,     Fwhat the possible link is to
OL,13,     Fpharmaceuticals billionaire
OL,14,     FFreddie Klink. Realising that the
OL,15,     Fscientist possibly hid a
OL,16,     Fbreakthrough discovery, the team
OL,17,     Fmust crack a cryptic code to
OL,18,     Fretrieve it and fend off the
OL,19,     Fmurderous efforts of other parties
OL,20,     Fequally interested in getting
OL,21,     Ftheir hands on it
